}
```

For example, if you want to add a second object with the function name "function_name_2" and its code, vulnerability, and reason, you would add the following object to the "output_list" array:

```json
{
    "output_list": [
        {
            "function_name": "<function_name_1>",
            "code": "<code_of_the_function1>",
            "vulnerability": "<short_vulnera_desc_1>",
            "reason": "<reason_1>"
        },
        {
            "function_name": "function_name_2",
